          "id": "leopard",
          "gloss": "leopard",
          "definition": "A spotted predatory cat known for its speed and its habit of lying in wait.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "ref": "Jer.13.23",
              "role": "defining",
              "note": "The leopard’s spots illustrate something as fixed as the colour of a person’s skin."
            },
            {
